{%- comment -%}
  Senseless — Complete your prep (complementary format cross-sell)
  Canonical: "Format Positioning & Cross-Sell Spec" (Site Build OS). Cream is the foundation;
  Gel + Spray are complementary. The reason to own more than one format is appointment-type /
  treatment-area + preference + readiness — NEVER in-session combination (compliance, LOCKED).
  Each format reads standalone-competent.

  Two complementary format cards + a "Compare formats" CTA. Variant by host:
  A = Cream page (push Spray + Gel), B = Spray page (push Cream + Gel), C = Gel page (push Cream + Spray).
  Cards link to the sibling format COLLECTIONS until products/variants exist and can be linked
  by matching strength (then bind per the spec). Place BELOW main content and ABOVE the Foaming
  Cleanser aftercare cross-link — prep ≠ aftercare, never merge.

  Variant resolution: explicit setting (cream/spray/gel) wins; 'auto' detects the host product's
  format from metafield `senseless.format` → product.type → tags (format_* / cream|gel|spray).
  If 'auto' cannot resolve a format (e.g. not a product page, or products not yet created),
  the section renders nothing — so it is safe to stage on the product template now.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign fmt = section.settings.variant
  if fmt == 'auto'
    assign detected = ''
    assign mf = product.metafields.senseless.format.value | downcase
    assign ptype = product.type | downcase
    assign probe = mf | append: ' ' | append: ptype
    assign tagstr = product.tags | join: ' ' | downcase
    assign probe = probe | append: ' ' | append: tagstr
    if probe contains 'spray'
      assign detected = 'spray'
    elsif probe contains 'gel'
      assign detected = 'gel'
    elsif probe contains 'cream'
      assign detected = 'cream'
    endif
    assign fmt = detected
  endif

  assign eyebrow = 'Complete your prep'
  case fmt
    when 'cream'
      assign headline = 'One appointment type rarely tells the whole story.'
      assign body = 'Cream is the everyday choice and the one most clients start with. If your calendar also runs to body-scale laser or waxing, the Spray covers ground a cream can’t. For longer, sustained sittings, many reach for the Gel. Different appointments, different formats — plenty of clients keep more than one.'
      assign card1_label = 'Spray'
      assign card1_handle = 'numbing-spray'
      assign card2_label = 'Gel'
      assign card2_handle = 'numbing-gel'
    when 'spray'
      assign headline = 'Spray for the broad work. Cream for the rest.'
      assign body = 'Spray suits body-scale and broader zones. For face and detail appointments — lip fillers, Botox, SPMU — Cream is the format most clinics work with. Many clients keep both, so they’re ready whatever the booking.'
      assign card1_label = 'Cream'
      assign card1_handle = 'numbing-cream'
      assign card2_label = 'Gel'
      assign card2_handle = 'numbing-gel'
    when 'gel'
      assign headline = 'Gel for the long sittings. Cream and Spray for everything else.'
      assign body = 'Gel earns its place across sustained sessions. Cream remains the everyday default for face and detail; Spray covers body-scale work. Different appointments call for different formats, and many clients keep more than one.'
      assign card1_label = 'Cream'
      assign card1_handle = 'numbing-cream'
      assign card2_label = 'Spray'
      assign card2_handle = 'numbing-spray'
  endcase
-%}

{%- if headline != blank -%}
{%- style -%}
  .ss-prep { background: var(--ss-bg, #f7f7f5); color: #1A1816; border-top: 1px solid #E5E2DC; }
  .ss-prep__inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 20px; }
  .ss-prep__head { max-width: 62ch; margin: 0 auto 28px; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .ss-prep__eyebrow { font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6B3FA0; margin: 0; }
  .ss-prep__headline { font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0; color: #1A1816; }
  .ss-prep__body { font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; color: #2B2730; margin: 0; }
  .ss-prep__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .ss-prep__card { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #E5E2DC; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; text-decoration: none; color: #1A1816; transition: transform 200ms ease-out, border-color 200ms ease-out; }
  .ss-prep__card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: rgba(26,24,22,0.28); }
  .ss-prep__media { flex: 0 0 96px; width: 96px; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; background: var(--ss-bg, #f7f7f5); }
  .ss-prep__cardbody { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; padding: 16px 16px 16px 0; }
  .ss-prep__cardlabel { font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0; }
  .ss-prep__cardcue { font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: 13px; color: #6B3FA0; }
  .ss-prep__cardcue::after { content: ' →'; }
  .ss-prep__foot { text-align: center; margin-top: 24px; }
  .ss-prep__cta { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 44px; padding: 0 24px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid #1A1816; color: #1A1816; background: transparent; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; transition: background-color 200ms ease-out, color 200ms ease-out; }
  .ss-prep__cta:hover { background: #1A1816; color: #f7f7f5; }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .ss-prep__inner { padding: 80px 40px; }
    .ss-prep__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .ss-prep__card, .ss-prep__cta { transition: none; } .ss-prep__card:hover { transform: none; } }
{%- endstyle -%}

<section class="ss-prep senseless-section" aria-label="{{ eyebrow }}">
  <div class="ss-prep__inner">
    <header class="ss-prep__head">
      <p class="ss-prep__eyebrow">{{ eyebrow }}</p>
      <h2 class="ss-prep__headline">{{ headline }}</h2>
      <p class="ss-prep__body">{{ body }}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="ss-prep__grid">
      {%- assign c1 = collections[card1_handle] -%}
      <a class="ss-prep__card" href="{{ c1.url | default: '/collections/' | append: card1_handle }}">
        <span class="ss-prep__media">{%- render 'senseless-card-image', collection: c1, alt: card1_label | append: ' — Senseless topical preparation on a warm off-white background', sizes: '96px' -%}</span>
        <span class="ss-prep__cardbody">
          <span class="ss-prep__cardlabel">{{ card1_label }}</span>
          <span class="ss-prep__cardcue">View {{ card1_label }}</span>
        </span>
      </a>

      {%- assign c2 = collections[card2_handle] -%}
      <a class="ss-prep__card" href="{{ c2.url | default: '/collections/' | append: card2_handle }}">
        <span class="ss-prep__media">{%- render 'senseless-card-image', collection: c2, alt: card2_label | append: ' — Senseless topical preparation on a warm off-white background', sizes: '96px' -%}</span>
        <span class="ss-prep__cardbody">
          <span class="ss-prep__cardlabel">{{ card2_label }}</span>
          <span class="ss-prep__cardcue">View {{ card2_label }}</span>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="ss-prep__foot">
      <a class="ss-prep__cta" href="{{ section.settings.compare_url | default: '/pages/choosing-your-format' }}">Compare formats</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Senseless — Complete prep",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "senseless-section senseless-complete-prep",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Complementary format cross-sell. 'Auto' picks the variant from the host product's format (metafield senseless.format → product type → tags); renders nothing if it can't resolve, so it is safe to stage on the product template before products exist." },
    { "type": "select", "id": "variant", "label": "Variant", "default": "auto", "options": [ { "value": "auto", "label": "Auto (detect product format)" }, { "value": "cream", "label": "Cream page (A)" }, { "value": "spray", "label": "Spray page (B)" }, { "value": "gel", "label": "Gel page (C)" } ] },
    { "type": "url", "id": "compare_url", "label": "Compare formats link", "info": "Set to /pages/choosing-your-format" }
  ],
  "presets": [ { "name": "Senseless — Complete prep", "settings": { "variant": "cream" } } ]
}
{% endschema %}
